{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838b197e9a7ddafc4e3a510213370378fea2f898b9aef5e04fb63ea2c39e2c53",
      "text": "那封信，到底流落到哪里去了呢。\n神谷，你手头还留着吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a0fd4c12271458af1b2debbb2e130e62aa8a0075867f35d355cbffcb2bf116",
      "text": "这个嘛，找找说不定会有……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9d463bda53daac44b7c300d9c700c3ad0b59afb29142e0332f61f678e437af8",
      "text": "果然是庄一郎吗！闻到一阵香气便下楼来\n查看……呵，果然没猜错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e241df81e5e2eada3c5721087312df44297b1afd77be410141845b78e6d454b9",
      "text": "原来是阿斯兰，来得正好。\n要不要和我们一起去事务所？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000093:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e87e704da87e6403439657db06e0f00966decf7a98633d2107a5ec1bb8d26ab5",
      "text": "参加感谢祭的成员，\n将是Cafe Parade和Altessimo。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf2651c0ea1855807388abb242c24d5d3c7919f3463848229ed1a1933b79f4e",
      "text": "圭、丽君，请多关照。如果有服务方面\n不懂的地方，随时来问我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcce97f0457c5a210bd10724a7ffefa894ac16ec90550980a889ae271341abb2",
      "text": "帮大忙了。\n我们对招待客人这方面不太了解……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78646bece6b990b55d95815f6d4e9b79c53b6a6ef574eeeba56f4509f560f6ac",
      "text": "毕竟至今为止，我们都是被款待的那一方呢。\nCafe Parade的各位，请多指教喽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7eaa83bbe7c4a62206fd6e857132f0bee0aa4acad55001372f621b08e16cef9",
      "text": "因此，我们有件事想和Cafe Parade的各位商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c80dec9713cd6141d0656dd14fd3e0ee4b5e95f67a1ab00683b28e0deffefad",
      "text": "可以在幸广的店里，\n让我们练习一下侍应生的工作吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84bfd4b59b6e7ac4aff58ff90d633228be1621b46c2176760f8fba0a1191f670",
      "text": "不仅是为了学习待客之道，\n我认为这对培养全员的默契也是很有必要的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:944ed180fe2cc8f6d5192043b5179f00c40e324b2e5438d8f2e8dafce72808f2",
      "text": "啊，我也正想这么提议呢！\n为了让感谢祭成功，大家一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000181:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8c0806b97d93cbdfec927a9cf9f1d08a6cc49915f67e356c9942a41750f3bdd",
      "text": "……啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n现在能稍微打扰一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000190:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c74295a75961dad0a7ee74d30b1499425fee4f9a3c2891003d0600ca6ce81f0d",
      "text": "听说Cafe Parade的大家\n要举办感谢祭……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35ac3b8d9a041697afec2b351896293b7dca3909d6ae903aa6ef7aefe55c37f7",
      "text": "我想着要是能稍微支持一下就好了，\n就打了这通电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000194:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47b7284838f1466c2dbb3d0e4a51f62d81bb864a7b417f9bd341c5f885e9bce1",
      "text": "啊，我当然不是在担心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88e8014f2b5fb3a3dc60dcff866bb39b8ee9599db1ef2b9d2ea8342cbc8cfad0",
      "text": "毕竟在成为偶像之前，\n我就听说过Cafe Parade的好口碑了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef6e9ac6eced4d265a0ca69a5c7f082ae48806c95489954067d6e3a2df0217c",
      "text": "前些天，天使酱也跟我讲过这样的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000200:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50c846f4b92cac1c5a8ad24f58d14ab252b3803e91d49127b134613d2a180836",
      "text": "说那是一家非常棒的咖啡厅，让人想一去\n再去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000202:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0323365bf4df2ff135df2ff8eda672ad390a08fdecf6fb41e90992ae09dc631e",
      "text": "这太令人心安了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000204:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bf3a04eec87b79561e27fd753a15ec2d2893ae54977d16d4db99a91ec772fc2",
      "text": "是啊。有这样一群人在的活动，\n一定会成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000206:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af8c0ca72a387bc42c9588836bd2332a41acf464150af30c1d24557134788108",
      "text": "而且还有你在嘛。\n那么，今天就先聊到这里……先挂了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
